<title>NORWAY: RGI 9-month profits fall.</title>
<headline>RGI 9-month profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>			 (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating revenue	     6,353     vs	5,184</p>
<p> Operating result		  354     vs	  576</p>
<p> Result after financial items  318     vs	  789</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of Norwegian fisheries-based investment group is RGI ASA. RGI said it attributed the fall in profits to the fisheries division. RGI is meant to merge with offshore engineering and building materials group Aker ASA under a proposal by the boards of both companies to be discussed at shareholders' meetings on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
